C) X-Rendi-Client-Id sin vinculo / revocado / autoreferencia
========================================================================
  atacante sin vinculo  GET /api/operations -> 403 {"detail":"Sin acceso a ese cliente"}
  atacante sin vinculo  GET /api/export/transactions.csv -> 403 {"detail":"Sin acceso a ese cliente"}
  asesor REVOCADO       GET /api/operations -> 403 {"detail":"Sin acceso a ese cliente"}
  header=' 1 '          -> 200 [{"id":1,"user_id":1,"date":"2026-01-10","broker":"B
  header='+1'           -> 200 [{"id":1,"user_id":1,"date":"2026-01-10","broker":"B
  header='01'           -> 200 [{"id":1,"user_id":1,"date":"2026-01-10","broker":"B
  header='abc'          -> 400 {"detail":"X-Rendi-Client-Id inválido"}
  header='-1'           -> 400 {"detail":"X-Rendi-Client-Id inválido"}
  header='0'            -> 400 {"detail":"X-Rendi-Client-Id inválido"}
  header='9223372036854775808' -> 400 {"detail":"X-Rendi-Client-Id inválido"}
  header='1e3'          -> 400 {"detail":"X-Rendi-Client-Id inválido"}

